# Valid header/action checksums and MD5, but the record declares 0xffffffff
# payload bytes even though the file only contains 16. Zig must reject it
# before trying to transmit data; C oracle only runs `check`, not `upgrade`.
@mark image
@hpm/image.hex
@truncate 88
@poke image 68 0xff
@poke image 69 0xff
@poke image 70 0xff
@poke image 71 0xff
@md5 image
